{
    "0": {
        "34_0": {
            "lines": [
                "It's like night down here!"
            ]
        },
        "42_0": {
            "lines": [
                "You can see in from outside,",
                "but not the other way around."
            ]
        },
        "50_0": {
            "lines": [
                "What's going on?",
                "This doesn't seem like your everyday barrier..."
            ]
        },
        "118_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Hohoh, you're..."
            ]
        },
        "156_0": {
            "lines": [
                "No way! A human down here?"
            ]
        },
        "164_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Huh? You're...",
                "Uhhh..."
            ]
        },
        "172_0": {
            "lines": [
                "I've never seen a youkai like you.",
                "Are you even a youkai?"
            ]
        },
        "180_0": {
            "lines": [
                "I am much, much older than any youkai. "
            ]
        },
        "188_0": {
            "lines": [
                "And much, much more than",
                "the yamanba who call this place home."
            ]
        },
        "196_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Some yamanba called Chirizuka",
                "was having some trouble earlier."
            ]
        },
        "204_0": {
            "lines": [
                "You've met with Chirizuka?",
                "She should have fled to the outside by now."
            ]
        },
        "212_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Exactly, she'd been forced out already.",
                "And was having trouble getting back inside."
            ]
        },
        "220_0": {
            "lines": [
                "So what you're saying is",
                "that you came in from the outside? "
            ]
        },
        "228_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Boy, I don't appreciate lies.",
                "There's no way you could've done that..."
            ]
        },
        "236_0": {
            "lines": [
                "There's no way that's possible at all!"
            ]
        }
    },
    "1": {
        "34_0": {
            "lines": [
                "I'm not lying."
            ]
        },
        "42_0": {
            "lines": [
                "This Incident Stone's power broke",
                "the barrier around the sanctuary."
            ]
        },
        "50_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Incident Stone?"
            ]
        },
        "58_0": {
            "lines": [
                "I see... This natural power",
                "is indeed that of an incident."
            ]
        },
        "74_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Come on,",
                "tell me what's happening in the sanctuary."
            ]
        },
        "82_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Events like this aren't uncommon.",
                "That's why they call these places sanctuaries."
            ]
        },
        "90_0": {
            "lines": [
                "I've seen this many times myself,",
                "but it seems like this is the first time for the yamanba."
            ]
        },
        "98_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Judging from the way you speak,",
                "do you <i$not> know why it happens? "
            ]
        },
        "114_0": {
            "lines": [
                "But I think I know what's going on.",
                "Probably. Maybe."
            ]
        },
        "122_0": {
            "lines": [
                "She doesn't know anything..."
            ]
        },
        "130_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Well, maybe this underground altar ",
                "has something to do with it."
            ]
        },
        "138_0": {
            "lines": [
                "An underground altar...?",
                "I guess I'll go look."
            ]
        },
        "66_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Come on,",
                "tell me what's happening in the sanctuary."
            ]
        },
        "106_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Well, I've lived a long time,",
                "so it's not like I'm unaware."
            ]
        },
        "146_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Still, using an incident's power...?",
                "It's a force colder than snow."
            ]
        },
        "154_0": {
            "lines": [
                "I'm not sure the altar would accept it...",
                "It's a pretty ancient belief, after all."
            ]
        }
    }
}